1a:[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"A paragraph plan you can fill with your own facts","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"A paragraph plan you can fill with your own facts"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Paragraph",{"scope":"col","children":"Paragraph"}],["$","th","Evidence to collect",{"scope":"col","children":"Evidence to collect"}],["$","th","Question answered",{"scope":"col","children":"Question answered"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Direction"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"A specific problem, interest or goal"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"What do you want to pursue?"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Preparation"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"A project, responsibility and observable result"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Why are you ready?"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Programme fit"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Verified module, method or resource"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Why this training?"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","3",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Future contribution"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"A feasible action and remaining limitations"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"How would you use it?"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"]
1b:["$","section","1-An illustrative letter: notice how the parts connect",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"An illustrative letter: notice how the parts connect"}],[["$","p","The following short example uses a fictional student and fictional programme details. It teaches structure, not wording to copy. A real letter would need the exact prompt, verified course details and the applicant's own record.",{"children":"The following short example uses a fictional student and fictional programme details. It teaches structure, not wording to copy. A real letter would need the exact prompt, verified course details and the applicant's own record."}]],"$undefined","$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"sample-card","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"sample-card__label","children":"Teaching example"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Fictional teaching example — adapt the reasoning, not the identity"}],[["$","p","0",{"children":"Dear Selection Committee, I am applying for the proposed environmental data programme because I want to improve how small community projects evaluate water use. During my undergraduate work, I became interested in the gap between collecting measurements and making decisions from them."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"For my final-year project, I organised a small set of field observations and documented inconsistent readings before analysing the results. My first approach produced a weak comparison, so I revised the collection sheet and recorded the limitations. The project taught me to question the quality of evidence before presenting a conclusion."}],["$","p","2",{"children":"My next learning need is a stronger foundation in statistical modelling and uncertainty. In a real application, I would identify the verified module or research resource that addresses that gap, explain what I understand about it and connect it to the work I have already attempted."}],["$","p","3",{"children":"After the programme, my first aim would be to test a clearer evaluation method with one community project and document what it can and cannot show. Funding would make the training financially possible, but I would still check the award's conditions and costs. I would welcome the opportunity to develop this plan through the programme."}]],["$","p",null,{"className":"sample-card__note","children":"Not a successful application, actual course description or personal experience. Do not submit this text as your own."}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
1c:["$","section","2-Why the example is stronger than generic praise",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Why the example is stronger than generic praise"}],[["$","p","The opening names a problem instead of declaring lifelong passion. The evidence paragraph explains a task, a personal contribution and a limitation. The programme paragraph identifies a learning need and requires a real source. The final paragraph proposes a manageable first action rather than promising to transform an entire sector.",{"children":"The opening names a problem instead of declaring lifelong passion. The evidence paragraph explains a task, a personal contribution and a limitation. The programme paragraph identifies a learning need and requires a real source. The final paragraph proposes a manageable first action rather than promising to transform an entire sector."}],["$","p","For your draft, underline what you personally did and circle the detail that could only describe the chosen opportunity. If neither is easy to find, the paragraph needs more research or more specific evidence.",{"children":"For your draft, underline what you personally did and circle the detail that could only describe the chosen opportunity. If neither is easy to find, the paragraph needs more research or more specific evidence."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Replace adjectives with a defensible claim","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Replace adjectives with a defensible claim"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Weak statement",{"scope":"col","children":"Weak statement"}],["$","th","Better direction",{"scope":"col","children":"Better direction"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"I am a natural leader."}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Explain a decision, who was involved and what changed."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Your university is world famous."}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Identify a verified resource that solves your learning gap."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"I will change my country."}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Describe a first feasible project, partners and limitations."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","3",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"I deserve this scholarship."}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Demonstrate fit with the published purpose and criteria."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
1d:["$","section","3-Read the prompt before choosing a template",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Read the prompt before choosing a template"}],[["$","p","Start with the actual question, selection criteria, language, word or character limit, required file type and permitted assistance. A motivation letter, personal statement and statement of purpose may overlap, but a programme can use those labels differently. The instructions decide what your document must do.",{"children":"Start with the actual question, selection criteria, language, word or character limit, required file type and permitted assistance. A motivation letter, personal statement and statement of purpose may overlap, but a programme can use those labels differently. The instructions decide what your document must do."}],["$","p","Write the requirements above your working draft. If the award asks about development impact, leadership or financial need, do not let a generic academic story replace those answers. If it prohibits AI-generated application content, do not submit generated examples from this page; prepare your own response under its rules.",{"children":"Write the requirements above your working draft. If the award asks about development impact, leadership or financial need, do not let a generic academic story replace those answers. If it prohibits AI-generated application content, do not submit generated examples from this page; prepare your own response under its rules."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L24",null,{"id":"guides/motivation-letter:section-4","title":"Check your progress","items":["Exact prompt and selection criteria saved","Programme and scholarship names verified","Length and file instructions confirmed","Rules on writing assistance checked"]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
1e:["$","section","4-Explain funding without making it your only argument",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Explain funding without making it your only argument"}],[["$","p","If the prompt asks about need, describe the relevant financial constraint accurately and proportionately. Do not invent hardship or disclose unnecessary sensitive details. Explain the part of the proposed training that the award would make possible and check any required supporting evidence.",{"children":"If the prompt asks about need, describe the relevant financial constraint accurately and proportionately. Do not invent hardship or disclose unnecessary sensitive details. Explain the part of the proposed training that the award would make possible and check any required supporting evidence."}],["$","p","A financial need does not replace academic or professional fit. Keep the programme argument visible and separate confirmed costs from assumptions. A letter should not suggest that you have secured admission or funding when either decision is still pending.",{"children":"A financial need does not replace academic or professional fit. Keep the programme argument visible and separate confirmed costs from assumptions. A letter should not suggest that you have secured admission or funding when either decision is still pending."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
1f:["$","section","5-Revise content, credibility and format separately",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Revise content, credibility and format separately"}],[["$","p","First check whether you answered the question. Next inspect the evidence: dates, project names, responsibilities and results should agree with your CV and application form. Finally edit language and formatting. This order prevents polishing a paragraph that belongs to a different prompt.",{"children":"First check whether you answered the question. Next inspect the evidence: dates, project names, responsibilities and results should agree with your CV and application form. Finally edit language and formatting. This order prevents polishing a paragraph that belongs to a different prompt."}],["$","p","Read the draft aloud and remove sentences that repeat the CV without explaining relevance. Ask a reviewer to describe your proposed direction after reading it once. If they cannot, simplify the argument before adding more words.",{"children":"Read the draft aloud and remove sentences that repeat the CV without explaining relevance. Ask a reviewer to describe your proposed direction after reading it once. If they cannot, simplify the argument before adding more words."}]],["$","ol",null,{"className":"process-steps","aria-label":"Revise content, credibility and format separately","children":[["$","li","Answer every part of the prompt",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":1}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Answer every part of the prompt"}]]}],["$","li","Verify each factual claim and programme detail",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":2}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Verify each factual claim and programme detail"}]]}],["$","li","Remove repeated or unrelated material",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":3}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Remove repeated or unrelated material"}]]}],["$","li","Check length, format and assistance rules",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":4}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Check length, format and assistance rules"}]]}],["$","li","Save the correct final file and submission record",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":5}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Save the correct final file and submission record"}]]}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
20:["$","section","6-Keep the rest of the application consistent",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Keep the rest of the application consistent"}],[["$","p","Your letter explains fit; your CV makes evidence easy to locate; references provide an independent assessment; the interview tests whether you can explain the same decisions. Reuse verified facts across these documents, but let each answer its own question.",{"children":"Your letter explains fit; your CV makes evidence easy to locate; references provide an independent assessment; the interview tests whether you can explain the same decisions. Reuse verified facts across these documents, but let each answer its own question."}],["$","p","If an example is difficult to defend in an interview, revise the claim now. A modest result with clear ownership is more useful than an impressive assertion that cannot be supported.",{"children":"If an example is difficult to defend in an interview, revise the claim now. A modest result with clear ownership is more useful than an impressive assertion that cannot be supported."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Keep the rest of the application consistent","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/scholarship-cv/",{"href":"/guides/scholarship-cv/","children":["Build a scholarship CV",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/statement-of-purpose/",{"href":"/guides/statement-of-purpose/","children":["Compare a statement of purpose",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/scholarship-interview/",{"href":"/guides/scholarship-interview/","children":["Prepare interview evidence",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
21:["$","section",null,{"className":"source-section","aria-labelledby":"official-sources","children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"official-sources","children":"Official sources and verification"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Source records support the guide. Page update dates describe editorial changes; they do not mean every linked rule was checked again today. Reopen the current call for your programme and intake."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"source-grid","children":[["$","$L4","https://europass.europa.eu/en/create-europass-cover-letter",{"href":"https://europass.europa.eu/en/create-europass-cover-letter","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Europass: cover-letter organisation"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"General structure guidance; scholarship instructions decide required content and length."}]]}],["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M15 3h6v6","key":"1q9fwt"}],["path",{"d":"M10 14 21 3","key":"gplh6r"}],["path",{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6","key":"a6xqqp"}]],"className":"lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
